<title>USA: G7 calls on IMF to agree quota revision before HK.</title>
<headline>G7 calls on IMF to agree quota revision before HK.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-06-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Group of Seven said that as the International Monetary Fund needed to have continued adequate resources, it should complete its review of quotas by its September meeting in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>The call came in the economic statement issued during the G7 summit here.</p>
</text>
